# What the next push runs (design.md, "順序"). One run per push.
# PHASE: shape    A only, to see whether and how CI stalls (first push)
#        compare  blocks of A, B, M, BM in rotated order (after shape passes)
#        ci-identical  CI's own `swift test` with its build, one A per job
#                      (only if shape finds no stall, design.md)
# BLOCKS: jobs in this run; FIRST_BLOCK numbers them, so a later push adds
# blocks with numbers of their own.
PHASE=compare
BLOCKS=24
FIRST_BLOCK=101
TRIALS_PER_JOB=4
